<title>THAILAND: Thai rice vessels loading and movements at July 4.</title>
<headline>Thai rice vessels loading and movements at July 4.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Thai Commerce Ministry and independent surveyors detailed rice loading at Thai ports as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>Vessel		Date of Arrival   Quantity     Destination</p>
<p>XIN TONG	    18/06/97		2,000	  Vietnam</p>
<p>MENG LONG Y.03    18/06/97		3,000	  China</p>
<p>GALACTICA	   20/06/97		9,000	  Singapore</p>
<p>PIPOB SAMUT	 20/06/97		1,200	  Japan</p>
<p>Bang Khunprom     23/06/97		4,800	  Malaysia</p>
<p>QSIP PYATNITSKY   23/06/97		6,000	  Indonesia</p>
<p>DIEN BIEN 02	23/06/97		6,000	  Indonesia</p>
<p>FEI YUE	     24/06/97		6,000	  China</p>
<p>ASIAN WIES	  24/06/97		3,800	  China</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
